# SELinux contexts for the DFG control interface.
#
# file_contexts (label the sysfs nodes at boot; the kernel types them
# sysfs_dfg because the label matches, per the sysfs SELinux LSM):
#
#   /sys/devices/platform/dfg(/.*)?  u:object_r:sysfs_dfg:s0
#
# seapp_contexts (run the app in its own domain):
#
#   user=system domain=dfg_controller_app name=com.daisyforgaming.controller
#
# If genfscon-based sysfs labelling is used instead (some Android
# versions), add to genfs_contexts:
#
#   genfscon sysfs /devices/platform/dfg u:object_r:sysfs_dfg:s0